    "Plan_Document": {
      "title": "Lekalo Native Gate Execution Plan",
      "description": "Closed contract for one immutable native gate execution plan Successor of the v0.3.2 native gate plan (issue #61; the v0.3.2 enums are never silently broadened). Closed contract for one immutable native gate execution plan (issue #48): the discovered workspace and package graph, the input and scan custody digests, the changed inputs, the affected-package closure with per-package reasons and exclusions, the proposed gate commands with exact relative cwd, literal argv, env recipe, tool references, dependencies and per-command limits, the capability snapshot, the whole-run run eligibility, and the plan digest over the canonical plan with the digest member absent. The plan is a proposal only: it never authorizes its own execution — an external approval naming this exact digest is required, and the approval never lives inside the plan.",
